                  ],
                ),
              ),
              const Gap(HSpace.md),
              PanelBlock(
                padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(vertical: HSpace.sm),
                child: Column(
                  children: [
                    SwitchListTile(
                      value: notif,
                      onChanged: (v) => ref
                          .read(boolPrefProvider('pref_announcements').notifier)
